            "text": "`EVAL-FIX-delta` declares `cited_by: SPEC-FIX-cited-only`, and `cites_evidence` requires both ends, so check/spec/02-cited-only.md owes `cites_evidence`",
            "markdown": "`EVAL-FIX-delta` declares `cited_by: SPEC-FIX-cited-only`, and `cites_evidence` requires both ends, so check/spec/02-cited-only.md owes `cites_evidence`\n\n**Fix:** add `cites_evidence: EVAL-FIX-delta` under `relations:` in check/spec/02-cited-only.md\n\n_Not reported: held by the adoption task AD-1, owned by the fixture tree, until 2027-01-01._"
